e4823aec44a42a82503b1_345693586586592864.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e安装缺少的扩展\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e安装缺少的扩展\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/000ca51700fe4823aec44a42a82503b1_345693586586592864.png srcset=\"/000ca51700fe4823aec44a42a82503b1_345693586586592864_hu13537063864574289033.webp 800w, /000ca51700fe4823aec44a42a82503b1_345693586586592864_hu6319195001690123537.webp 1200w, /000ca51700fe4823aec44a42a82503b1_345693586586592864_hu7338879776428194074.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"安装缺少的扩展\" height=\"430\" width=\"803\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e安装缺少的扩展\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e安装 pecl 成功后可能会提示，需要把路径添加到环境变量中：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/8d50f5b7bd1643c28541ec5f15123959_17290394394824949103.png\" title=\"添加环境变量\" data-thumbnail=\"/8d50f5b7bd1643c28541ec5f15123959_17290394394824949103.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e添加环境变量\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e添加环境变量\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/8d50f5b7bd1643c28541ec5f15123959_17290394394824949103.png srcset=\"/8d50f5b7bd1643c28541ec5f15123959_17290394394824949103_hu11219983186662848003.webp 800w, /8d50f5b7bd1643c28541ec5f15123959_17290394394824949103_hu9726174081755055102.webp 1200w, /8d50f5b7bd1643c28541ec5f15123959_17290394394824949103_hu7317566693622705845.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"添加环境变量\" height=\"457\" width=\"838\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e添加环境变量\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/1e42802019fb4a29be9a7f483f091952_10698075233709454009.png\" title=\"添加环境变量\" data-thumbnail=\"/1e42802019fb4a29be9a7f483f091952_10698075233709454009.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e添加环境变量\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e添加环境变量\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/1e42802019fb4a29be9a7f483f091952_10698075233709454009.png srcset=\"/1e42802019fb4a29be9a7f483f091952_10698075233709454009_hu2225778886077758340.webp 800w, /1e42802019fb4a29be9a7f483f091952_10698075233709454009_hu5782197015260129828.webp 1200w, /1e42802019fb4a29be9a7f483f091952_10698075233709454009_hu3795292688414933384.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"添加环境变量\" height=\"258\" width=\"537\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e添加环境变量\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003epecl 安装成功\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/fca28af9ef5f40ff891aabbb56c288dd_18257796746682647138.png\" title=\"pecl 安装成功\" data-thumbnail=\"/fca28af9ef5f40ff891aabbb56c288dd_18257796746682647138.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003epecl 安装成功\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003epecl 安装成功\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/fca28af9ef5f40ff891aabbb56c288dd_18257796746682647138.png srcset=\"/fca28af9ef5f40ff891aabbb56c288dd_18257796746682647138_hu8775534811685871639.webp 800w, /fca28af9ef5f40ff891aabbb56c288dd_18257796746682647138_hu3940967850228516403.webp 1200w, /fca28af9ef5f40ff891aabbb56c288dd_18257796746682647138_hu13474183741424707886.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"pecl 安装成功\" height=\"429\" width=\"1119\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003epecl 安装成功\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"安装-swoole\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85-swoole\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e4 安装 swoole\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e照着官方文档安装即可，\u003ca href=\"https://wiki.swoole.com/zh-cn/#/environment?id=pecl:~:text=Copied-,PECL,-%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3A%20PECL%20%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e安装文档\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    code-block-title \n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        tw-select-none \n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-block\n        group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90\n        tw-transition-[transform] \n        tw-duration-500 \n        tw-ease-in-out\n        print:!tw-hidden\"\n      disabled\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"code-block-title-bar tw-w-full\"\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003etext\u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-11 12.31l-5.61 7c-4 5.07-5.25 10.13-2.8 14.88l1.05 1.93c3 5.76 6.29 7.8