-keyfile\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e文件\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e├── mongo-arbiter-data\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e文件夹\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e├── mongo1-data\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e文件夹\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e├── mongo2-data\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e文件夹\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e└── mongo3-data\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e文件夹\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/3e6402e8e40244d7ad9ec18f7c79dbed_315470230593343431.png\" title=\"目录结构\" data-thumbnail=\"/3e6402e8e40244d7ad9ec18f7c79dbed_315470230593343431.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e目录结构\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e目录结构\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/3e6402e8e40244d7ad9ec18f7c79dbed_315470230593343431.png srcset=\"/3e6402e8e40244d7ad9ec18f7c79dbed_315470230593343431_hu4952280949414949503.webp 800w, /3e6402e8e40244d7ad9ec18f7c79dbed_315470230593343431_hu3597963713729453390.webp 1200w, /3e6402e8e40244d7ad9ec18f7c79dbed_315470230593343431_hu16941109399072567504.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"目录结构\" height=\"223\" width=\"668\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e目录结构\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003edocker-compose.yaml\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n 