6.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-block \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-hidden \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw-block tw-m-0 tw-p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-8\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      !tw-block \n      tw-p-0\n      tw-m-0\n      tw-transition-[max-height] \n      tw-duration-500 \n      tw-ease-in-out \n      group-[.is-closed]:!tw-max-h-0 \n      group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-wrap\n      tw-overflow-y-hidden\n      tw-overflow-x-auto\n      tw-scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003enpm i d:\\tmp\\node-sum\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/ca420dae84014b20b6240bbf3bc43cea_7601857719042294856.png\" title=\"安转本地节点并重启\" data-thumbnail=\"/ca420dae84014b20b6240bbf3bc43cea_7601857719042294856.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e安转本地节点并重启\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e安转本地节点并重启\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/ca420dae84014b20b6240bbf3bc43cea_7601857719042294856.png srcset=\"/ca420dae84014b20b6240bbf3bc43cea_7601857719042294856_hu15574476972620743456.webp 800w, /ca420dae84014b20b6240bbf3bc43cea_7601857719042294856_hu78275051570027860.webp 1200w, /ca420dae84014b20b6240bbf3bc43cea_7601857719042294856_hu2443569071507472916.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"安转本地节点并重启\" height=\"662\" width=\"757\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e安转本地节点并重启\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e然后重启 node-red 就可以看到刚才安装的节点了。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/b6e7c77292a64f69924bf9e29c758748_15019111968608349346.png\" title=\"节点安装成功\" data-thumbnail=\"/b6e7c77292a64f69924bf9e29c758748_15019111968608349346.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e节点安装成功\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e节点安装成功\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/b6e7c77292a64f69924bf9e29c758748_15019111968608349346.png srcset=\"/b6e7c77292a64f69924bf9e29c758748_15019111968608349346_hu17305180255854086783.webp 800w, /b6e7c77292a64f69924bf9e29c758748_15019111968608349346_hu259087859959737646.webp 1200w, /b6e7c77292a64f69924bf9e29c758748_15019111968608349346_hu16194415741777090518.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"节点安装成功\" height=\"97\" width=\"283\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e节点安装成功\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"测试功能\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e6%b5%8b%e8%af%95%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e4.6 测试功能\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e把节点拖到工作区，双击节点（会触发\u003ccode\u003eoneditprepare\u003c/code\u003e函数）打开编辑区\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/4b0152769e1a4380bdd53f293076ef10_15220644695285536015.png\" title=\"双节节点填写编辑区\" data-thumbnail=\"/4b0152769e1a4380bdd53f293076ef10_15220644695285536015.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e双节节点填写编辑区\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e双节节点填写编辑区\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/4b0152769e1a4380bdd53f293076ef10_15220644695285536015.png srcset=\"/4b0152769e1a4380bdd53f293076ef10_15220644695285536015_hu11075496878450872787.webp 800w, /4b0152769e1a4380bdd53f293076ef10_15220644695285536015_hu8911174556351150824.webp 1200w, /4b0152769e1a4380bdd53f293076ef10_15220644695285536015_hu4942558267321876186.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"双节节点填写编辑区\" height=\"257\" width=\"909\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e双节节点填写编辑区\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e填写完编辑区内容后点击完成（会触发\u003ccode\u003eoneditsave\u003c/code\u003e函数），点击部署就会在调试窗口输出 \u003ccode\u003enode.send\u003c/code\u003e 信息。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/adc4ec6a9f5442a584eff58a95a07496_114928830780885224.png\" title=\"部署\" data-thumbnail=\"/adc4ec6a9f5442a584eff58a95a07496_114928830780885224.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e部署\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e部署\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/adc4ec6a9f5442a584eff58a95a07496_114928830780885224.png srcset=\"/adc4ec6a9f5442a584eff58a95a07496_114928830780885224_hu4216600108850925386.webp 800w, /adc4ec6a9f5442a584eff58a95a07496_114928830780885224_hu3095340074641755214.webp 1200w, /adc4ec6a9f5442a584eff58a95a07496_114928830780885224_hu3754160609884083368.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"部署\" height=\"280\" width=\"1189\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e部署\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"参考\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%8f%82%e8%80%83\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e5 参考\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://nodered.org/docs/creating-nodes/first-node\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eCreating your first node\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/node-red/node-red/wiki/Design:-i18n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eDesign: i18n\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n",
        "language": "zh-cn"
    },
    {
        "title" : "常见设计模式-Go实现",
        "date_published" : "2021-10-20T00:00:00Z",
        "date_modified" : "2022-11-17T11:51:30+08:00",
        "id" : "https://www.xiaobinqt.cn/design-patterns/",
        "url" : "https://www.xiaobinqt.cn/design-patterns/",
        "summary": " 1 创建型模式 1.1 单例模式保证一个类永远只能有一个对象，并提供一个访问它的全局访问点，且该对象的功能依然能被其他模块使用。\n",
        "author" : {
          "name" : "xiaobinqt"
        },
        "content_html" : "\u003c!-- author： xiaobinqt --\u003e\n\u003c!-- email： xiaobinqt@163.com --\u003e\n\u003c!-- https://xiaobinqt.github.io --\u003e\n\u003c!-- https://www.xiaobinqt.cn --\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"创建型模式\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%88%9b%e5%bb%ba%e5%9e%8b%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8f\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1 创建型模式\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"单例模式\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%8d%95%e4%be%8b%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8f\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1.1 单例模式\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e保证一个类永远只能有一个对象，并提供一个访问它的全局访问点，且该对象的功能依然能被其他模块使用。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e因为在系统内存中只存在一个对象，单例可以节省系统资源。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    code-block-title \n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        tw-select-none \n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-block\n        group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90\n        tw-transition-[transform] \n        tw-duration-500 \n        tw-ease-in-out\n        print:!tw-hidden\"\n      disabled\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"code-block-title-bar tw-w-full\"\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003ego\u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-11 12.31l-5.61 7c-4 5.07-5.25 10.13-2.8 14.88l1.05 1.93c3 5.76 6.29 7.88 12.25 7.88h4.73c10.33 0 15.94 2.44 15.94 9.09 0 4.72-4.2 8.22-14.36 8.22a41.54 41.54 0 0 1-15.47-3.12c-6.49-3.88-11.74-3.5-15.6 3.12l-5.59 9.31c-3.72 6.13-3.19 11.72 2.63 15.94 7.71 4.69 20.38 9.44 37 9.44 34.16 0 48.5-22.75 48.5-44.12-.03-14.38-9.12-29.76-28.73-34.88zM496 224H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0-160H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V80a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0 320H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zM16 160h64a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H64V40a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H32a8 8 0 0 0-7.14 4.42l-8 16A8 8 0 0 0 24 64h8v64H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8zm-3.91 160H80a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H41.32c3.29-10.29 48.34-18.68 48.34-56.44 0-29.06-25-39.56-44.47-39.56-21.36 0-33.8 10-40.46 18.75-4.37 5.59-3 10.84 2.8 15.37l8.58 6.88c5.61 4.56 11 2.47 16.12-2.44a13.44 13.44 0 0 1 9.46-3.84c3.33 0 9.28 1.56 9.28 8.75C51 248.19 0 257.31 0 304.59v4C0 316 5.08 320 12.09 320z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"