        "summary": " 1 下载镜像在 CentOS 的官网 https://wiki.centos.org/Download 可以下载 CentOS 各个版本的镜像文件。\nCentOS Download 包括已经不在维护的各个版本：\n",
        "author" : {
          "name" : "xiaobinqt"
        },
        "content_html" : "\u003c!-- author： xiaobinqt --\u003e\n\u003c!-- email： xiaobinqt@163.com --\u003e\n\u003c!-- https://xiaobinqt.github.io --\u003e\n\u003c!-- https://www.xiaobinqt.cn --\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"下载镜像\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bd%e9%95%9c%e5%83%8f\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1 下载镜像\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e在 CentOS 的官网 \u003ca href=\"https://wiki.centos.org/Download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003ehttps://wiki.centos.org/Download\u003c/a\u003e 可以下载 CentOS 各个版本的镜像文件。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/b74714e1b8a14d97898350923f9bdc9a_11945973597694268130.png\" title=\"CentOS Download\" data-thumbnail=\"/b74714e1b8a14d97898350923f9bdc9a_11945973597694268130.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eCentOS Download\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCentOS Download\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/b74714e1b8a14d97898350923f9bdc9a_11945973597694268130.png srcset=\"/b74714e1b8a14d97898350923f9bdc9a_11945973597694268130_hu9259335928162085.webp 800w, /b74714e1b8a14d97898350923f9bdc9a_11945973597694268130_hu13112726486279046914.webp 1200w, /b74714e1b8a14d97898350923f9bdc9a_11945973597694268130_hu18348071633256654408.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"CentOS Download\" height=\"549\" width=\"1218\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eCentOS Download\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e包括已经不在维护的各个版本：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/ec976869da494f84bf74d765ed21b59c_3174742902856691023.png\" title=\"Archived Versions\" data-thumbnail=\"/ec976869da494f84bf74d765ed21b59c_3174742902856691023.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eArchived Versions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eArchived Versions\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/ec976869da494f84bf74d765ed21b59c_3174742902856691023.png srcset=\"/ec976869da494f84bf74d765ed21b59c_3174742902856691023_hu9110869801324617600.webp 800w, /ec976869da494f84bf74d765ed21b59c_3174742902856691023_hu5264422229911581542.webp 1200w, /ec976869da494f84bf74d765ed21b59c_3174742902856691023_hu16144085722502673849.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"Archived Versions\" height=\"777\" width=\"531\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eArchived Versions\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e也可以去阿里的镜像仓库去下载 \u003ca href=\"https://mirrors.aliyun.com/centos/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003emirrors.aliyun.com/centos\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"安装-centos-79\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85-centos-79\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2 安装 CentOS 7.9\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e下载完 \u003ca href=\"https://mirrors.aliyun.com/centos/7.9.2009/isos/x86_64/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eCentOS-7-x86_64-Minimal-2009\u003c/a\u003e 就可以安装了，这里用的是 Minimal 版本，安装完成后，系统中只有最基本的组件，方便学习。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/b3e26ed50cd849c4acb1fd03eda92705_50821103568510351.png\" title=\"新建虚拟机\" data-thumbnail=\"/b3e26ed50cd849c4acb1fd03eda92705_50821103568510351.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e新建虚拟机\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e新建虚拟机\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/b3e26ed50cd849c4acb1fd03eda92705_50821103568510351.png srcset=\"/b3e26ed50cd849c4acb1fd03eda92705_50821103568510351_hu2814313451961410688.webp 800w, /b3e26ed50cd849c4acb1fd03eda92705_50821103568510351_hu15570991709891014542.webp 1200w, /b3e26ed50cd849c4acb1fd03eda92705_50821103568510351_hu5421157014287133659.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"新建虚拟机\" height=\"313\" width=\"454\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e新建虚拟机\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/8a9a3656b1f14461847da9924c730acb_338324708582887689.png\" title=\"典型配置\" data-thumbnail=\"/8a9a3656b1f14461847da9924c730acb_338324708582887689.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e典型配置\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e典型配置\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/8a9a3656b1f14461847da9924c730acb_338324708582887689.png srcset=\"/8a9a3656b1f14461847da9924c730acb_338324708582887689_hu6880274088462595820.webp 800w, /8a9a3656b1f14461847da9924c730acb_338324708582887689_hu7666634412530090447.webp 1200w, /8a9a3656b1f14461847da9924c730acb_338324708582887689_hu18388157681418312287.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"典型配置\" height=\"455\" width=\"566\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e典型配置\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/f31b7d2ae48548d9b9273829a75fc4d6_9554681218619755423.png\" title=\"选择 ios 文件\" data-thumbnail=\"/f31b7d2ae48548d9b9273829a75fc4d6_9554681218619755423.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e选择 ios 文件\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e选择 ios 文件\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/f31b7d2ae48548d9b9273829a75fc4d6_9554681218619755423.png srcset=\"/f31b7d2ae48548d9b9273829a75fc4d6_9554681218619755423_hu6441611441727440900.webp 800w, /f31b7d2ae48548d9b9273829a75fc4d6_9554681218619755423_hu12097191319332101559.webp 1200w, /f31b7d2ae48548d9b9273829a75fc4d6_9554681218619755423_hu5702243133037898127.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"选择 ios 文件\" height=\"493\" width=\"603\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e选择 ios 文件\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e命名虚拟机并选择系统文件保存路径：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/ba19b8c62ee94986985291c00dd5a88c_15540594642347301652.png\" title=\"命名虚拟机\" data-thumbnail=\"/ba19b8c62ee94986985291c00dd5a88c_15540594642347301652.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e命名虚拟机\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e命名虚拟机\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/ba19b8c62ee94986985291c00dd5a88c_15540594642347301652.png srcset=\"/ba19b8c62ee94986985291c00dd5a88c_15540594642347301652_hu4119993158026801604.webp 800w, /ba19b8c62ee94986985291c00dd5a88c_15540594642347301652_hu7644350490156356453.webp 1200w, /ba19b8c62ee94986985291c00dd5a88c_15540594642347301652_hu3916595802173131509.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"命名虚拟机\" height=\"463\" width=\"607\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e命名虚拟机\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e如果物理机支持大与 4GB 以上的单文件，可以选择“将虚拟磁盘存储为单个文件”\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/72fc8ae20afe4887809079325a562115_17686849698766188594.png\" title=\"指定磁盘容量\" data-thumbnail=\"/72fc8ae20afe4887809079325a562115_17686849698766188594.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e指定磁盘容量\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e指定磁盘容量\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/72fc8ae20afe4887809079325a562115_17686849698766188594.png srcset=\"/72fc8ae20afe4887809079325a562115_17686849698766188594_hu7212292389702850584.webp 800w, /72fc8ae20afe4887809079325a562115_17686849698766188594_hu3098561322113993150.webp 1200w, /72fc8ae20afe4887809079325a562115_17686849698766188594_hu4719606967297471426.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"指定磁盘容量\" height=\"449\" width=\"548\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e指定磁盘容量\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/439029d3f584484582121b347112eaa0_16473151431630699395.png\" title=\"自定义硬件\" data-thumbnail=\"/439029d3f584484582121b347112eaa0_16473151431630699395.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e自定义硬件\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e自定义硬件\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/439029d3f584484582121b347112eaa0_16473151431630699395.png srcset=\"/439029d3f584484582121b347112eaa0_16473151431630699395_hu1177178579023127435.webp 800w, /439029d3f584484582121b347112eaa0_16473151431630699395_hu3413056601034457240.webp 1200w, /439029d3f584484582121b347112eaa0_16473151431630699395_hu6113024184413481755.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"自定义硬件\" height=\"452\" width=\"576\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e自定义硬件\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e由于服务器用不到声卡，USB 控制器，打印机这些设备，可以将这些设备移除：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/c13f3ed6b3d5458fbf9c9a676894eb43_9585490776146172983.png\" title=\"移除硬件\" data-thumbnail=\"/c13f3ed6b3d5458fbf9c9a676894eb43_9585490776146172983.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e移除硬件\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e移除硬件\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/c13f3ed6b3d5458fbf9c9a676894eb43_9585490776146172983.png srcset=\"/c13f3ed6b3d5458fbf9c9a676894eb43_9585490776146172983_hu10620990854474449457.webp 800w, /c13f3ed6b3d5458fbf9c9a676894eb43_9585490776146172983_hu16011404167666054070.webp 1200w, /c13f3ed6b3d5458fbf9c9a676894eb43_9585490776146172983_hu17313093150649085762.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"移除硬件\" height=\"803\" width=\"759\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e移除硬件\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/15df2863d25b49d7a76ec9bdc6b617b9_9099032712565281199.png\" title=\"移除后的硬件\" data-thumbnail=\"/15df2863d25b49d7a76ec9bdc6b617b9_9099032712565281199.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e移除后的硬件\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e移除后的硬件\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/15df2863d25b49d7a76ec9bdc6b617b9_9099032712565281199.png srcset=\"/15df2863d25b49d7a76ec9bdc6b617b9_9099032712565281199_hu18146590290319480764.webp 800w, /15df2863d25b49d7a76ec9bdc6b617b9_9099032712565281199_hu5492581884981049492.webp 1200w, /15df2863d25b49d7a76ec9bdc6b617b9_9099032712565281199_hu9495319107788503509.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"移除后的硬件\" height=\"784\" width=\"740\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e移除后的硬件\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可以\u003cstrong\u003e不用\u003c/strong\u003e勾选「创建后开启此虚拟机选项」：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/d5663f41d9ee4c25a9d842ee42d92d17_9806032564469740857.png\" title=\"完成\" data-thumbnail=\"/d5663f41d9ee4c25a9d842ee42d92d17_9806032564469740857.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e完成\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e完成\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/d5663f41d9ee4c25a9d842ee42d92d17_9806032564469740857.png srcset=\"/d5663f41d9ee4c25a9d842ee42d92d17_9806032564469740857_hu15897662899936927451.webp 800w, /d5663f41d9ee4c25a9d842ee42d92d17_9806032564469740857_hu4664442019554297526.webp 1200w, /d5663f41d9ee4c25a9d842ee42d92d17_9806032564469740857_hu2108889917794726203.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"完成\" height=\"464\" width=\"595\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e完成\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/476f763d3cbc41d4839429bca8b3175e_9342530856343234768.png\" title=\"开启虚拟机\" data-thumbnail=\"/476f763d3cbc41d4839429bca8b3175e_9342530856343234768.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e开启虚拟机\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e开启虚拟机\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/476f763d3cbc41d4839429bca8b3175e_9342530856343234768.png srcset=\"/476f763d3cbc41d4839429bca8b3175e_9342530856343234768_hu13869784801774886173.webp 800w, /476f763d3cbc41d4839429bca8b3175e_9342530856343234768_hu7176232548795442574.webp 1200w, /476f763d3cbc41d4839429bca8b3175e_9342530856343234768_hu8553579227695744136.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"开启虚拟机\" height=\"390\" width=\"723\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e开启虚拟机\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/c9840008ce6144e5a91e17e33c03d3bf_4331140936488674457.png\" title=\"Install CentOS7\" data-thumbnail=\"/c9840008ce6144e5a91e17e33c03d3bf_4331140936488674457.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eInstall CentOS7\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstall CentOS7\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/c9840008ce6144e5a91e17e33c03d3bf_4331140936488674457.png srcset=\"/c9840008ce6144e5a91e17e33c03d3bf_4331140936488674457_hu9999123526142465347.webp 800w, /c9840008ce6144e5a91e17e33c03d3bf_4331140936488674457_hu18287250602229178748.webp 1200w, /c9840008ce6144e5a91e17e33c03d3bf_4331140936488674457_hu1074010133624808763.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"Install CentOS7\" height=\"422\" width=\"675\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eInstall CentOS7\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/a939c8c699a042aaa1b0cb6bdbd85b60_12986215943989674089.png\" title=\"安装中\" data-thumbnail=\"/a939c8c699a042aaa1b0cb6bdbd85b60_12986215943989674089.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e安装中\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e安装中\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/a939c8c699a042aaa1b0cb6bdbd85b60_12986215943989674089.png srcset=\"/a939c8c699a042aaa1b0cb6bdbd85b60_12986215943989674089_hu7556627890548782751.webp 800w, /a939c8c699a042aaa1b0cb6bdbd85b60_12986215943989674089_hu4346945340903380433.webp 1200w, /a939c8c699a042aaa1b0cb6bdbd85b60_12986215943989674089_hu18424110017013555848.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"安装中\" height=\"578\" width=\"919\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e安装中\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/a1e517684d1946fa9f560b4a848eaaff_2662503607069677495.png\" title=\"选择语言\" data-thumbnail=\"/a1e517684d1946fa9f560b4a848eaaff_2662503607069677495.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e选择语言\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e选择语言\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/a1e517684d1946fa9f560b4a848eaaff_2662503607069677495.png srcset=\"/a1e517684d1946fa9f560b4a848eaaff_2662503607069677495_hu9720012922565872347.webp 800w, /a1e517684d1946fa9f560b4a848eaaff_2662503607069677495_hu16166316272436209125.webp 1200w, /a1e517684d1946fa9f560b4a848eaaff_2662503607069677495_hu12224682580005987525.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"选择语言\" height=\"638\" width=\"857\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e选择语言\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e点击 INSTALLATION DESTINATION\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/f78e0f23022749eb88895182d245375f_14227434105189078041.png\" title=\"INSTALLATION DESTINATION\" data-thumbnail=\"/f78e0f23022749eb88895182d245375f_14227434105189078041.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/f78e0f23022749eb88895182d245375f_14227434105189078041.png srcset=\"/f78e0f23022749eb88895182d245375f_14227434105189078041_hu15060495323581136904.webp 800w, /f78e0f23022749eb88895182d245375f_14227434105189078041_hu6776351917832435751.webp 1200w, /f78e0f23022749eb88895182d245375f_14227434105189078041_hu6154489922768447911.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"INSTALLATION DESTINATION\" height=\"606\" width=\"808\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION 默认值不用改，直接点 Done\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/0f3fef4c733c499eb1f6690d1421280b_13785774756019156940.png\" title=\"INSTALLATION DESTINATION Done\" data-thumbnail=\"/0f3fef4c733c499eb1f6690d1421280b_13785774756019156940.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION Done\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION Done\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/0f3fef4c733c499eb1f6690d1421280b_13785774756019156940.png srcset=\"/0f3fef4c733c499eb1f6690d1421280b_13785774756019156940_hu17923895473329160090.webp 800w, /0f3fef4c733c499eb1f6690d1421280b_13785774756019156940_hu10145456410372444697.webp 1200w, /0f3fef4c733c499eb1f6690d1421280b_13785774756019156940_hu9182296789915314799.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"INSTALLATION DESTINATION Done\" height=\"604\" width=\"804\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eINSTALLATION DESTINATION Done\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/a9563032d90c46f0aaf001b848b486b7_8119372507465926752.png\" title=\"Begin Installation\" data-thumbnail=\"/a9563032d90c46f0aaf001b848b486b7_8119372507465926752.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eBegin Installation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBegin Installation\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/a9563032d90c46f0aaf001b848b486b7_8119372507465926752.png srcset=\"/a9563032d90c46f0aaf001b848b486b7_8119372507465926752_hu2330304497880838580.webp 800w, /a9563032d90c46f0aaf001b848b486b7_8119372507465926752_hu15888944129490460892.webp 1200w, /a9563032d90c46f0aaf001b848b486b7_8119372507465926752_hu10757334457068973615.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"Begin Installation\" height=\"597\" width=\"818\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eBegin Installation\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如果想要创建带桌面的虚拟机，可以在 SOFTWARE SELECTION 中选择 GNOME Desktop：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/fad64195e6e64249a5a26bad0fb928c7_1739391172832773827.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/fad64195e6e64249a5a26bad0fb928c7_1739391172832773827.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eGNOME Desktop\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/fad64195e6e64249a5a26bad0fb928c7_1739391172832773827.png srcset=\"/fad64195e6e64249a5a26bad0fb928c7_1739391172832773827_hu5727834504828339.webp 800w, /fad64195e6e64249a5a26bad0fb928c7_1739391172832773827_hu18221138269966270534.webp 1200w, /fad64195e6e64249a5a26bad0fb928c7_1739391172832773827_hu4040279144475634786.webp 1600w\"   height=\"611\" width=\"826\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eGNOME Desktop\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e设置 ROOT 密码和创建用户\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/3352639ce0dd4648b3dcebf1b2bc69dd_259983612275083939.png\" title=\"设置 ROOT 密码和创建用户\" data-thumbnail=\"/3352639ce0dd4648b3dcebf1b2bc69dd_259983612275083939.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e设置 ROOT 密码和创建用户\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e设置 ROOT 密码和创建用户\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/3352639ce0dd4648b3dcebf1b2bc69dd_259983612275083939.png srcset=\"/3352639ce0dd4648b3dcebf1b2bc69dd_259983612275083939_hu8437190095528532626.webp 800w, /3352639ce0dd4648b3dcebf1b2bc69dd_259983612275083939_hu18322267270102441859.webp 1200w, /3352639ce0dd4648b3dcebf1b2bc69dd_259983612275083939_hu13400742324196646827.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"设置 ROOT 密码和创建用户\" height=\"604\" width=\"807\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e设置 ROOT 密码和创建用户\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/066889c865c44947bde9387c1e5187a1_17189802483101665749.png\" title=\"创建用户\" data-thumbnail=\"/066889c865c44947bde9387c1e5187a1_17189802483101665749.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e创建用户\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e创建用户\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/066889c865c44947bde9387c1e5187a1_17189802483101665749.png srcset=\"/066889c865c44947bde9387c1e5187a1_17189802483101665749_hu13183529842786128037.webp 800w, /066889c865c44947bde9387c1e5187a1_17189802483101665749_hu12161264324361287844.webp 1200w, /066889c865c44947bde9387c1e5187a1_17189802483101665749_hu7330134422469313972.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"创建用户\" height=\"607\" width=\"811\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e创建用户\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e等待安装任务\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/d411484eb47847dfb51dd5c24ef58de8_14880220177686741561.png\" title=\"等待安装任务\" data-thumbnail=\"/d411484eb47847dfb51dd5c24ef58de8_14880220177686741561.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e等待安装任务\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e等待安装任务\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/d411484eb47847dfb51dd5c24ef58de8_14880220177686741561.png srcset=\"/d411484eb47847dfb51dd5c24ef58de8_14880220177686741561_hu4401309253867771315.webp 800w, /d411484eb47847dfb51dd5c24ef58de8_14880220177686741561_hu5982542587594343642.webp 1200w, /d411484eb47847dfb51dd5c24ef58de8_14880220177686741561_hu10164240255382493415.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"等待安装任务\" height=\"607\" width=\"805\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e等待安装任务\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/154217e8813f421fbb8649a3816d1c79_15050628817881733949.png\" title=\"安装任务完成重启\" data-thumbnail=\"/154217e8813f421fbb8649a3816d1c79_15050628817881733949.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e安装任务完成重启\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e安装任务完成重启\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/154217e8813f421fbb8649a3816d1c79_15050628817881733949.png srcset=\"/154217e8813f421fbb8649a3816d1c79_15050628817881733949_hu9332468965718347858.webp 800w, /154217e8813f421fbb8649a3816d1c79_15050628817881733949_hu15543093266739730253.webp 1200w, /154217e8813f421fbb8649a3816d1c79_15050628817881733949_hu1355417393435124023.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"安装任务完成重启\" height=\"606\" width=\"811\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e安装任务完成重启\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e重启完成登录\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/3585320091a1411586204f12701ccd94_7871982639227192805.png\" title=\"root Login\" data-thumbnail=\"/3585320091a1411586204f12701ccd94_7871982639227192805.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eroot Login\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eroot Login\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/3585320091a1411586204f12701ccd94_7871982639227192805.png srcset=\"/3585320091a1411586204f12701ccd94_7871982639227192805_hu14746006136639239406.webp 800w, /3585320091a1411586204f12701ccd94_7871982639227192805_hu17534136018549423705.webp 1200w, /3585320091a1411586204f12701ccd94_7871982639227192805_hu6219696641648314526.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"root Login\" height=\"147\" width=\"456\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eroot Login\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"网络配置\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e7%bd%91%e7%bb%9c%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e3 网络配置\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e一般新装的\u003cstrong\u003e最小化\u003c/strong\u003e的 CentOS 7.x 系统是没有网络配置的，而安装命令就是联网下载软件，所以网络配置是必须的。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/3a7a989e2f68499e853cc206c3eb9a13_9346854121073395864.png\" title=\"ping\" data-thumbnail=\"/3a7a989e2f68499e853cc206c3eb9a13_9346854121073395864.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eping\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eping\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/3a7a989e2f68499e853cc206c3eb9a13_9346854121073395864.png srcset=\"/3a7a989e2f68499e853cc206c3eb9a13_9346854121073395864_hu12869801372727702037.webp 800w, /3a7a989e2f68499e853cc206c3eb9a13_9346854121073395864_hu12830218993845066390.webp 1200w, /3a7a989e2f68499e853cc206c3eb9a13_9346854121073395864_hu17632745992721686104.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"ping\" height=\"101\" width=\"478\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eping\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCentOS 7.x 的默认网卡是 essxx，我们可以在配置文件 \u003ccode\u003e/etc/syconfig/network-scripts\u003c/code\u003e 中看到：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/b09768d8763041f0bcefe58d5dbea5c6_13095687616985276089.png\" title=\"network-scripts\" data-thumbnail=\"/b09768d8763041f0bcefe58d5dbea5c6_13095687616985276089.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003enetwork-scripts\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003enetwork-scripts\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/b09768d8763041f0bcefe58d5dbea5c6_13095687616985276089.png srcset=\"/b09768d8763041f0bcefe58d5dbea5c6_13095687616985276089_hu15141832114967586704.webp 800w, /b09768d8763041f0bcefe58d5dbea5c6_13095687616985276089_hu6222244965141587235.webp 1200w, /b09768d8763041f0bcefe58d5dbea5c6_13095687616985276089_hu4084390451718218925.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"network-scripts\" height=\"190\" width=\"868\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003enetwork-scripts\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可以先把 ifcfg-ensxx 这个文件\u003cstrong\u003e备份下\u003c/strong\u003e，然后修改 \u003ccode\u003eonboot\u003c/code\u003e 参数从 no 修改为 yes ，保存，重启机器。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/62dffe2555ef424e8f0009b9c3bc7be8_16615378666398929287.png\" title=\"update onboot\" data-thumbnail=\"/62dffe2555ef424e8f0009b9c3bc7be8_16615378666398929287.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eupdate onboot\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eupdate onboot\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/62dffe2555ef424e8f0009b9c3bc7be8_16615378666398929287.png srcset=\"/62dffe2555ef424e8f0009b9c3bc7be8_16615378666398929287_hu16743535263289852108.webp 800w, /62dffe2555ef424e8f0009b9c3bc7be8_16615378666398929287_hu13518776172054558052.webp 1200w, /62dffe2555ef424e8f0009b9c3bc7be8_16615378666398929287_hu17610018351717423526.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"update onboot\" height=\"298\" width=\"556\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eupdate onboot\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e重启完后就可以 ping 通网络了：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/5db4c9b9390f4617b8ca1a3e900ffa3f_13855157036083070114.png\" title=\"ping 2\" data-thumbnail=\"/5db4c9b9390f4617b8ca1a3e900ffa3f_13855157036083070114.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eping 2\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eping 2\u003c/p\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src=/5db4c9b9390f4617b8ca1a3e900ffa3f_13855157036083070114.png srcset=\"/5db4c9b9390f4617b8ca1a3e900ffa3f_13855157036083070114_hu5837646689950143670.webp 800w, /5db4c9b9390f4617b8ca1a3e900ffa3f_13855157036083070114_hu14541467908723847429.webp 1200w, /5db4c9b9390f4617b8ca1a3e900ffa3f_13855157036083070114_hu9171038673448485144.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"ping 2\" height=\"312\" width=\"720\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eping 2\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"ifconfig-command-not-found\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#ifconfig-command-not-found\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e4 ifconfig command not found\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e安装 net-tools 工具\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    code-block-title \n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        tw-select-none \n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-block\n        group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90\n        tw-transition-[transform] \n        tw-duration-500 \n        tw-ease-in-out\n        print:!tw-hidden\"\n      disabled\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"code-block-title-bar tw-w-full\"\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003eshell\u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-11 12.31l-5.61 7c-4 5.07-5.25 10.13-2.8 14.88l1.05 1.93c3 5.76 6.29 7.88 12.25 7.88h4.73c10.33 0 15.94 2.44 15.94 9.09 0 4.72-4.2 8.22-14.36 8.22a41.54 41.54 0 0 1-15.47-3.12c-6.49-3.88-11.74-3.5-15.6 3.12l-5.59 9.31c-3.72 6.13-3.19 11.72 2.63 15.94 7.71 4.69 20.38 9.44 37 9.44 34.16 0 48.5-22.75 48.5-44.12-.03-14.38-9.12-29.76-28.73-34.88zM496 224H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0-160H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V80a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0 320H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zM16 160h64a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H64